OL,3,GNEWSAAt-risk churches receive funding
OL,4,Afor urgent repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo historic churches in
OL,7,FLeicestershire, including one with a
OL,8,Fmooning man gargoyle, have received
OL,9,Ffunding for urgent repairs.
OL,11,FGrade I listed St Peter's Church in
OL,12,FWymondham, near Melton Mowbray, and St
OL,13,FJohn the Baptist in King's Norton near
OL,14,FOadby, will both benefit from thousands
OL,15,Fof pounds directed to them by the
OL,16,FNational Churches Trust.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
