OL,3,GNEWSAAt-risk churches receive funding
OL,4,Afor urgent repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe body said the bell tower at St
OL,7,FPeter's Church - which will receive
OL,8,F#6,500 from the Wolfson Foundation -
OL,9,Fwas a "health and safety risk" and its
OL,10,F"decaying" roof was letting water into
OL,11,Fthe building.
OL,13,FMeanwhile, St John the Baptist church
OL,14,Fwill receive #4,369 from the trust
OL,15,Fitself for its own roof repairs.
